To the Privacy / Data Protection team at {broker},

I am writing to request the removal and deletion of my personal information from your records and services, and to opt out of any sale, licensing, or sharing of that information.

{scope}

{property_note}

Please remove all records matching ANY of the following identifiers — every record, not only the most recent or primary one:

{identifiers}

I am requesting that you:
  1. Delete and suppress all personal information associated with the identifiers above from {broker} and every property listed above.
  2. Do not sell, license, share, or otherwise disclose this information to any third party.
  3. Do not re-create, re-acquire, or re-list this information from other sources following this request.
  4. Confirm in writing, to the sending email address, once the removal has been completed, and identify any records you were unable to remove and why.

{law}

Please treat this as a formal request and respond within the timeframe required by applicable law. If you require anything further from me to locate these records, reply to this email and I will provide what is reasonably necessary — though I ask that you not require the creation of an account or the submission of additional sensitive information (such as a full date of birth or government ID).

{reference}

Thank you for your prompt attention.

Sincerely,
{full_name}
